# ADR-0545 embedded-asset hermeticity: Buck2-native, cargo-free live-corpus gate over the real tree.
# The test collects every Rust include_str!/include_bytes! string-literal site, resolves each against
# the owning Buck target's sandbox destination set, and asserts the live corpus is born-blocking green
# on the unmapped-include code (the repo is hermetic today) while skip/no-target legacy debt stays
# under the reviewed shrink-only ceilings (FRIC-1781112000 anti-laundering). RED fixtures prove an
# unmapped include FAILS closed without touching the filesystem.
rust_test(
    name = "ci-embedded-asset-hermeticity-gate",
    srcs = glob(["tests/**/*.rs", "**/*.json"]),
    crate = "ci_embedded_asset_hermeticity_gate",
